  "notes": "{省|はぶ}く means to omit, leave out, or reduce unnecessary elements.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ particle\n\nTWO NUANCES:\n1. To omit/leave out: ⟦{詳細|しょうさい}→詳細：02523_shousai⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{省|はぶ}く (omit details)\n2. To save/reduce: ⟦{手間|てま}→手間：03554_tema⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{省|はぶ}く (save effort)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{手間|てま}→手間：03554_tema⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{省|はぶ}く: to save effort/time\n- ⟦{無駄|むだ}→無駄：02512_muda⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{省|はぶ}く: to eliminate waste\n- ⟦{説明|せつめい}→説明：01449_setsumei⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{省|はぶ}く: to skip explanations\n- ⟦{経費|けいひ}→経費：04696_keihi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{省|はぶ}く: to cut expenses\n- ⟦{時間|じかん}→時間：00468_jikan⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{省|はぶ}く: to save time\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{省略|しょうりゃく}→省略：03244_shouryaku⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to abbreviate, omit (more formal)\n- {省|はぶ}ける: can be omitted (potential form)\n- ⟦{手抜|てぬ}き→手抜き：07724_tenuki⟧: cutting corners",
